|i1 : kk = ZZ/101                                                             |
|                                                                             |
|o1 = kk                                                                      |
|                                                                             |
|o1 : QuotientRing                                                            |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i2 : S = kk[x,y,z]                                                           |
|                                                                             |
|o2 = S                                                                       |
|                                                                             |
|o2 : PolynomialRing                                                          |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i3 : R = S/ideal(x^2,y^2,z^2-x*y,x*z, y*z)                                   |
|                                                                             |
|o3 = R                                                                       |
|                                                                             |
|o3 : QuotientRing                                                            |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i4 : lastCyclesDegree = 4                                                    |
|                                                                             |
|o4 = 4                                                                       |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
