From this we see that [T_5, T_6] sends T_37 to -1 in kk.

Another, often simpler view of the pairing is given by *note bracketMatrix:
bracketMatrix,, where the rows and columns correspond to the generators of Pi^d
and Pi^e, and the entries are the bracket products, interpreted as elements of
Pi^{d+e}. Note the anti-symmetry, which holds when d or e are even and the
symmetry in the case both are odd.

